{"review_status": "needs_review", "label_status": "candidate_requires_human_review", "purpose": "first_round_functional_only_not_gold", "source_semantics_status": "source_grounded_candidate_not_human_certified", "scenario_id": "SC08", "question": "依企業實習問答，做超過160小時，就能拿超過2學分嗎？", "intent_group": "internship_credit", "family_id": "FIRST_ROUND_internship_credit", "query_order": 8, "split": "functional", "reference_scenario_id": "SC05", "expected_answer_reuse": "unverified", "candidate_expected_answer_reuse": "forbidden_for_narrow_reference", "reference_answer": "依企業實習問答，超過160小時仍只有2學分，不會增加學分；超過時數的薪資及相關保障依合約處理，學校仍提供課程輔導與支持。", "sources": [{"path": "畢業專題_爬蟲/type1/課程資訊_企業實習專區.txt", "sha256": "9185657b9f728073c1e51d20fd65d596e605da823d6ca1352e425a75958cf72d", "line_start": 215, "line_end": 217, "quote": "如果我實習時數超過160小時，可以有比較多學分嗎？\n不可以，如果你實習時數超過160小時，依舊只會有2學分。\n但超過之時數依舊可以依合約向實習企業索取薪資與相關保障，學校亦會提供課程輔導與支持。"}], "sc_query_id": "SC08", "expected_cache_behavior": {"none": "miss", "exact": "miss", "semantic": "miss_candidate"}, "reuse_note": "相近用語但資訊需求不同，不應直接重用窄範圍參考答案；若實際儲存回答包含所需資訊，仍需人工檢查。", "phase": "measured", "initial_cache": "empty_per_mode_and_repeat"}
